   "stem": {
      "text": "Let \\( f \\) be the function that satisfies \\( f'(x) = x^{2} + \\left(f(x)\\right)^{3} \\), with \\( f(0) = -1 \\). Find the second-degree Taylor polynomial for \\( f \\) about \\( x = 0 \\)."
   },
